    {
      "fileName": "kobold-breath.json",
      "id": "PPUNMjRLQYnmwQvF",
      "name": "Kobold Breath",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "PPUNMjRLQYnmwQvF",
        "folder": "DHDisl3wodueFQqb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Kobold Breath",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You channel the power of your draconic benefactor to expel a torrent of energy from your mouth that manifests as a @Template[type:line|distance:30] or a @Template[type:cone|distance:15], dealing @Damage[(ceil(@actor.level / 2))d4|options:area-damage] damage. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic saving throw against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. You can't use this ability again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Kobold Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p>At 3rd level and every 2 levels after that, the damage increases by 1d4. The breath shape, damage type, and the saving throw match those of your draconic benefactor, such as those shown on the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.kzxu2dI7tFxv6Ix6.JournalEntryPage.GduFISQ6kzEB6sec#draconic-benefactors]{Draconic Benefactors} table. This activity has the traits associated with the magical tradition of your draconic benefactor and the type of damage the breath deals.</p><hr /><p>@Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|options:area-damage] @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|options:area-damage] @Check[will|against:class-spell|options:area-damage]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "dragonscaled kobold heritage"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Draconic Codex"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "allowDuplicate": false,
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "predicate": [
